    "answer": {
      "short": "Upper fence: $175.5\\text{ cm}$. Correct answer: D.",
      "worked": "The lower half has middle values 148 and 148; the upper half has middle values 158 and 160.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}Q_1&=148\\text{ cm}\\\\Q_3&=\\frac{158+160}{2}=159\\text{ cm}\\\\\\text{IQR}&=159-148=11\\text{ cm}\\\\\\text{Upper fence}&=Q_3+1.5\\times\\text{IQR}\\\\\\text{Upper fence}&=159+1.5\\times11\\\\\\text{Upper fence}&=175.5\\text{ cm}\\end{align*}$$\n\nSince $179>175.5$, the height is an outlier. Correct answer: D.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
